ome a Demon King. She was a member of the archery club, so she can handle a bow a little, but she has no other combat skills. Because of this, she is treated as a useless Demon King."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c134875"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/230268607860ba3ee17f3c5136c67e393a6d3c67cee2bd47290e1dacd4c69464.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1cc15a78ca88fd4b80e569c83905cf05d2eb2ea06ff142269c8f0c7d63f2b126.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花寺 香蓮","creatorId":"vndb:s4474","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4474","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4474","name":"平野 有紗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96831","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c139537","characterName":"エルフィー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c139537"},"originalCharacterName":"エルフィー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"92"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"48"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an elf. She is good at magic and a reasonably good swordsman. She is one of the former demon king's lieutenants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a polite tone of voice and a calm and collected personality. When the former demon king was alive and well, she was in a secretarial position at but was clumsy at the best of times."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was the one who summoned Akari by mistake in the demon king summoning ceremony."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She speaks in a very relaxed tone to everyone, but talks to Akari in an overbearing tone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c139537"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61f03b892333c745354a2b5d1aba311ea795acab31aeb190f95412b16ca1089d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76ede60de6c4d7f948a6ce0c68349fefa20e9ac192998c73fa7706b495582f3a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八ッ橋 きなこ","creatorId":"vndb:s353","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s353","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s353","name":"八ッ橋きなこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96830","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c139538","characterName":"アルメア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c139538"},"originalCharacterName":"アルメア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"143"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"42"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is from the ogre race. Despite her appearance, she is a powerful woman. She is one of the former demon king's lieutenants."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a rough and random personality, but she is surprisingly intelligent. She has a dependable, sisterly side to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has two horns on her forehead, a characteristic of an ogre."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c139538"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9b84b55b6123c32922c3d4cd01b9a4b39801a111ff7894b00ea6def98deed1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d30f5b657267be4e13e9694cb6f64e9a23871f36cf75ae60386a4376b6a172ea.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乙倉 由依","creatorId":"vndb:s26305","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26305","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26305","name":"乙倉ゆい(乙倉ゅい、乙倉由依、愛花むぎ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:96832","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c139539","characterName":"ダムどん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c139539"},"originalCharacterName":"ダムどん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Remnants of the previous demon king. Its official name is “Damned-Voval-Ambuschias.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It is a being that only Akari can recognize, as she possesses the “Demon Core,” which is the proof of the Demon King. However, it is only within the Demon King's castle, and Damdon cannot leave the Demon King's castle."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He teaches Akari his knowledge of the other world and the Demon King. He is the one who advised Akari to rely on Elfie and Almea, his former subordinates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a mere remnant of his former great power and appearance. His appearance is a mascot-like figure, a far cry from his former (before his death) self."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c139539"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{